 "A small company": "Una pequeña empresa",
 "that shows its work.": "que muestra lo que hace.",
 "Glow Lab Protocols is family-run. There is no call centre, no fulfilment partner and no marketing department — which means when something is wrong, you are talking to the person who can fix it.": "Glow Lab Protocols es una empresa familiar. No tenemos centro de llamadas, socio de logística ni departamento de marketing. Si algo sale mal, hablas con la persona que puede resolverlo.",
 "What we stand on": "Nuestros principios",
 "Transparency is not a slogan here": "Aquí la transparencia no es un eslogan",
 "It is a set of specific things we do that most of this industry does not. Each one is checkable on this site right now.": "Es un conjunto de acciones concretas que gran parte de esta industria no realiza. Puedes comprobar cada una en este sitio.",
